I compared the pricing of 4 AI 3D generators: Tripo 3.1, Meshy 7, Rodin Gen-2.5 and Hi3D 3.0.

Here's how they stack up:

@tripoai : $19.90/month, 3,000 credits. Best for generation volume, with assets costing around $0.43–$0.63.

@MeshyAI : $20/month, 1,000 credits. Textured models cost around $0.60, with 4 free retries.

Rodin AI: $30/month, 30 credits. Standard generations cost $0.50 and include up to 5 variants, plus 20 geometry and 6 material redos.

@Hi3D_AI : $19.90/month, 1,000 credits. Quality generations cost around $2.09, while Master generations cost $9.05. You also get 6 free retries.

Tripo is the best for volume, Meshy for predictable pricing, Rodin for refinement, and Hi3D for high-resolution output.

A cheaper generation doesn't always mean a better deal. 

You also have to consider how many retries and edits you get before you end up with a model you're happy with.
